      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A rapid synthesis of CDP840 (a potential therapeutic agent for asthma), using 2-pyrimidyl vinyl sulfide as a platform, has been established. This method includes a stereoselective double Mizoroki-Heck-type arylation, a Liebeskind-Srogl-type cross-coupling reaction, and a Pd/C-catalyzed hydrogenation."},
